  "summary": {
    "ja": "既存配布版：極座標(r,θ)の双線形基底でCartesian速度2成分を近似し、円環の可変粘性応力発散BVPを解く。正確なrのJacobian、物理勾配、結合したひずみ弱形式を組み立てる。 追加固定例：回転異方性拡散：完全テンソルQ1とMG・AMG。条件と検証範囲は各配布版で確認してください。",
    "en": "Existing releases: Approximate two Cartesian velocity components with bilinear(r,theta) basis functions for an annular variable-viscosity stress BVP. Assemble the exact polar Jacobian,physical gradients and coupled strain weak form. Additional fixed examples: Rotated diffusion: full-tensor Q1, MG and AMG. See each release for assumptions and checked scope."
  },
