          "ja": "軸を除く円環で可変粘性の応力発散方程式を実際に解き、速度・歪み・境界tractionと仕事を照合します。",
          "en": "Actually solve variable-viscosity stress divergence on an annulus; check velocity, strain, physical traction and work."
        },
        "assumptions": {
          "ja": "1≤r≤2、theta周期、mu=1+.2r²、lambda=0、両円でu=0。A(s)=(s−1)(4−s)、u=(A(1+xy),A(x²−y²)/2)。Nr8/16/32、Ntheta=2Nr。",
          "en": "1≤r≤2, periodic angle, mu=1+.2r², lambda0 and zero velocity on both circles. A(s)=(s−1)(4−s), u=(A(1+xy),A(x²−y²)/2). Nr8/16/32,Ntheta2Nr."
        },
        "algorithm": {
          "ja": "polarのmapped Q1にCartesian速度2成分を置き、r dr dthetaで2mu epsilonの弱形式を4×4 Gauss積分してblock疎解法。円周faceにはr dthetaと外向き法線を使う。",
          "en": "Mapped polar Q1 with two Cartesian velocity components;4×4 Gauss integration of2mu epsilon uses exact r dr dtheta metric, followed by a block sparse solve. Circular traction uses r dtheta and outward normals."
        },
        "validation": {
          "ja": "独自解析外力を別のCartesian応力差分で資格確認。L2速度/歪み/traction細分化、反力/体積外力と物理tractionの収支、粘性散逸と外力仕事を別々に測定。 体積外力の解析積分(756pi/5,0)も別に照合。",
          "en": "Qualify the derived force by separate Cartesian stress differentiation. Measure velocity/strain/traction refinement, reactions versus volume-force/physical traction budgets, and viscous dissipation versus force work. Also check the independently integrated body force (756pi/5,0)."
        },
        "limits": {
          "ja": "線形vector粘性BVPです。divfree拘束・圧力・非線形Navier–Stokesは含めません。原点なしのr>0であり、軸stencil検証ではありません。",
          "en": "A linear vector viscous BVP, without divergence-free constraint, pressure or nonlinear Navier–Stokes. r>0 only; no axis stencil certification."
        },
